  <annotations>
    <text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(10, 20, 380, 60)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="15">1-2 Load and check roles</text>
    <text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(410, 20, 400, 75)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="15">3 Split first
Training = Data Sample; holdout = Remaining Data</text>
    <text id="2" type="text/plain" rect="(830, 20, 370, 75)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="15">4-6 Explore, preprocess and build
Preprocessor methods go to learners</text>
    <text id="3" type="text/plain" rect="(1230, 20, 500, 75)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="15">7-8 Validate and interpret
CV uses training only; holdout is a final check</text>
    <text id="4" type="text/plain" rect="(10, 860, 1680, 65)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="15">EDA and cleaning previews do not feed scoring. Rank is explanatory; learned selection belongs inside Preprocess. See implementation_guide.md for the teaching sequence and settings.</text>
  </annotations>
